WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Ask the Tarnwick vault a question. The search runs in your browser, with no key.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Hybrid search: vectors, words and typed links. Each of the 5 results says why it came in.

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Every sentence cites its source. The path lights the 3 links the answer walked.

4
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:43.000
A citation opens the exact passage the answer read.

5
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Measured on 40 held-out questions. Hybrid search and graph only tie: recall@5 91% and 93%.

6
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Three commands, no key: github.com/leonfpontes/graph-rag-vault
